  "notes": [
    "Fully regular reflexive -AR verb; follows standard endings throughout",
    "Always used with reflexive pronouns (me/te/se/nos/se)",
    "Takes *de* + noun/infinitive: *quejarse de algo* = to complain about something",
    "Takes *de que* + subjuntivo: *me quejo de que hagan ruido* = I complain that they make noise",
    "Past participle: quejado (regular)",
    "*Me quejo de que mis vecinos hagan demasiado ruido* = I complain that my neighbours make too much noise",
    "Non-reflexive *quejar* exists but is rare; *quejarse* is the standard form",
    "Related: la queja (complaint), un quejica (a complainer/moaner), quejumbroso/a (whiny)"
  ],
